units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 0.3000
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 1.4 12345 dist gaussian
pair_style lj/cut 4.0
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_modify tail yes
neighbor 0.3 bin
timestep 0.005
fix nvt all nvt temp 1.4 1.4 0.5

thermo 5000
run 20000

reset_timestep 0
variable Z equal press/(0.3000*1.4)
variable pe_atom equal pe
fix av all ave/time 100 10 1000 v_Z v_pe_atom file avg.txt
dump d all custom 600 traj.lammpstrj id x y z
dump_modify d sort id
run 200000
